1
00:00:27,527 --> 00:00:30,948
THE HUSBAND

2
00:00:35,202 --> 00:00:36,410
THIS SERIES IS FICTITIOUS

3
00:00:36,411 --> 00:00:39,039
CHILDREN WERE FILMED SAFELY
GEN AI WAS USED IN SELECT SCENES

4
00:00:57,766 --> 00:00:58,850
Yeah.

5
00:01:00,269 --> 00:01:02,312
EPISODE 11

6
00:01:43,353 --> 00:01:45,063
Why did you want to see me?

7
00:01:47,357 --> 00:01:49,651
You asked me

8
00:01:50,569 --> 00:01:52,362
if anyone else besides me and Ha Jeongsoo

9
00:01:52,988 --> 00:01:54,990
is in the know, right?

10
00:01:58,035 --> 00:01:59,411
The fetal stem cells.

11
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:04,249
Someone actually
introduced the idea to me.

12
00:02:07,419 --> 00:02:08,670
Was it Choi Chiung?

13
00:02:09,463 --> 00:02:10,464
Wait.

14
00:02:11,423 --> 00:02:12,716
You already knew?

15
00:02:18,597 --> 00:02:19,598
So what now?

16
00:02:20,599 --> 00:02:23,018
Who will save your wife if I die?

17
00:02:25,145 --> 00:02:27,813
Who else do you think will save your wife?

18
00:02:30,734 --> 00:02:31,860
Screw you!

19
00:02:55,300 --> 00:02:57,135
All you had to do was take out Kang Taeju.

20
00:02:58,220 --> 00:02:59,638
That's all you needed to do.

21
00:03:01,682 --> 00:03:04,309
You just had to stick to the plan.
Was that so hard?

22
00:03:08,063 --> 00:03:09,940
I'm out of options now.

23
00:03:12,025 --> 00:03:13,610
Anyway, that being said…

24
00:03:16,655 --> 00:03:19,616
I want you to get rid of my wife.

25
00:03:20,117 --> 00:03:22,577
What? What did you say?

26
00:03:24,454 --> 00:03:26,164
Get rid of my wife.

27
00:03:27,582 --> 00:03:29,084
I'll pay you, okay?

28
00:03:30,127 --> 00:03:31,628
I'll pay you 300… No.

29
00:03:32,796 --> 00:03:35,297
I'll pay you 500 million won.

30
00:03:35,298 --> 00:03:36,425
So please.

31
00:03:49,938 --> 00:03:52,190
I said get rid of Kang Taeju,
not kidnap Ko Seyun.

32
00:03:53,316 --> 00:03:54,484
It's all the same.

33
00:03:55,110 --> 00:03:57,446
Don't be ridiculous! How is this the same?

34
00:03:58,029 --> 00:04:00,949
As long as Kang Taeju is
out of the picture, right?

35
00:04:02,868 --> 00:04:04,202
Why don't you just hang tight?

36
00:04:06,163 --> 00:04:07,246
Hang tight?

37
00:04:07,247 --> 00:04:09,457
How's that going to solve any--

38
00:04:09,458 --> 00:04:10,459
Hello?

39
00:04:22,637 --> 00:04:25,056
KANG, SUSPECT IN WIFE'S KIDNAPPING
AND MURDER, ESCAPES

40
00:04:32,439 --> 00:04:33,814
What the hell happened?

41
00:04:33,815 --> 00:04:35,941
What's this about Taeju soliciting murder?

42
00:04:38,862 --> 00:04:40,780
Say something!

43
00:04:40,781 --> 00:04:42,532
That husband of hers went rogue.

44
00:04:43,700 --> 00:04:46,203
I told him to kill Kang Taeju,
but he kidnapped Ko Seyun.

45
00:04:47,704 --> 00:04:48,705
What did you say?

46
00:04:52,042 --> 00:04:53,794
You said you'd keep Taeju out of this.

47
00:04:55,921 --> 00:04:58,130
I swear…

48
00:04:58,131 --> 00:05:01,176
Have you been
after Taeju this whole time, not Ko Seyun?

49
00:05:06,848 --> 00:05:07,849
I'm going to the cops.

50
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:16,691
You're the one who wanted Ko Seyun gone
so you could have Kang Taeju.

51
00:05:19,653 --> 00:05:21,071
Make sure to tell them that too.

52
00:05:49,099 --> 00:05:50,182
978T 1863

53
00:05:50,183 --> 00:05:51,934
And in our next story,

54
00:05:51,935 --> 00:05:54,728
a factory shoot-out in Gyeonggi-do

55
00:05:54,729 --> 00:05:57,189
has left one police officer
in critical condition,

56
00:05:57,190 --> 00:06:01,820
and the whereabouts of the suspect,
Doctor Kang, remain unknown.

57
00:06:02,362 --> 00:06:06,699
As the suspect is armed
with live ammunition

58
00:06:06,700 --> 00:06:09,535
and is considered highly dangerous,

59
00:06:09,536 --> 00:06:13,372
police urge nearby residents
to stay away from the restricted area

60
00:06:13,373 --> 00:06:19,296
and to immediately report
any suspicious individual to the police.

61
00:07:12,599 --> 00:07:13,600
Shit.

62
00:07:35,497 --> 00:07:37,414
EMERGENCY SERVICES

63
00:07:37,415 --> 00:07:40,085
SAFE HOSPITAL
WITH TRUSTED MEDICAL SERVICE

64
00:07:55,642 --> 00:07:57,810
And get that woman
out of here too!

65
00:07:57,811 --> 00:07:59,145
Please let him do it.

66
00:08:01,272 --> 00:08:02,273
Seyun.

67
00:08:04,693 --> 00:08:05,694
Dad.

68
00:08:08,571 --> 00:08:10,407
Let Taeju operate on her.

69
00:08:11,658 --> 00:08:15,369
Seyun, that woman is a criminal.

70
00:08:15,370 --> 00:08:18,581
Not just any criminal.
She's the one who kidnapped you.

71
00:08:20,166 --> 00:08:21,459
I know,

72
00:08:22,836 --> 00:08:24,837
but I want to know why they did this

73
00:08:24,838 --> 00:08:26,840
and why they kidnapped me.

74
00:08:27,674 --> 00:08:29,843
I want to know the truth.

75
00:08:38,184 --> 00:08:40,061
RESTRICTED AREA

76
00:08:42,063 --> 00:08:43,815
The immediate crisis is over,

77
00:08:44,774 --> 00:08:46,317
and her vitals are steady for now.

78
00:08:50,030 --> 00:08:51,573
Good job.

79
00:08:52,741 --> 00:08:54,284
Well done…

80
00:08:56,411 --> 00:08:57,954
saving that woman.

81
00:09:10,425 --> 00:09:13,302
You said you'd pay up last time too.

82
00:09:13,303 --> 00:09:15,013
Why do you keep making me come back?

83
00:09:17,474 --> 00:09:19,517
I'm trying to pay you back, okay?

84
00:09:20,310 --> 00:09:24,189
We're businessmen here,
not a charity.

85
00:09:25,023 --> 00:09:27,983
You think 300 million won is a joke?

86
00:09:27,984 --> 00:09:30,819
And we gave you enough time, didn't we?

87
00:09:30,820 --> 00:09:33,823
- Wouldn't you agree, Doctor?
-  Sir, please.

88
00:09:34,407 --> 00:09:37,159
Once this project is done,
I'll get the money right away.

89
00:09:37,160 --> 00:09:39,412
I just need a little more time, please.

90
00:09:39,996 --> 00:09:41,414
No sense of money.

91
00:09:41,956 --> 00:09:43,958
And no sense of time either, huh?

92
00:09:44,584 --> 00:09:47,211
I'm tired of talking.

93
00:09:47,212 --> 00:09:48,420
- You.
-  Yes, boss.

94
00:09:48,421 --> 00:09:50,672
Find out
where his daughter's preschool is.

95
00:09:50,673 --> 00:09:52,424
-  Yes, boss.
- No, you can't!

96
00:09:52,425 --> 00:09:54,510
You can't! Please, sir.

97
00:09:54,511 --> 00:09:55,761
I'll give you your money!

98
00:09:55,762 --> 00:09:57,680
I'll pay you back tomorrow! Please!

99
00:09:58,890 --> 00:10:01,683
- Sir, please don't hurt my little girl.
-  Get off me.

100
00:10:01,684 --> 00:10:03,394
You'll pay for it if you do!
I swear!

101
00:10:07,148 --> 00:10:08,233
What's this about?

102
00:10:10,693 --> 00:10:12,195
You need cash, right?

103
00:10:13,071 --> 00:10:14,072
Sorry?

104
00:10:14,906 --> 00:10:16,699
Yeah, I know. How much is the debt?

105
00:10:18,368 --> 00:10:19,536
Three hundred million won.

106
00:10:25,250 --> 00:10:26,417
Dr. Choi.

107
00:10:28,253 --> 00:10:30,713
I'm actually in kind of a pinch right now.

108
00:10:32,006 --> 00:10:35,135
Could you lend me some money?

109
00:10:44,602 --> 00:10:47,272
That should cover way more than the debt.

110
00:10:54,279 --> 00:10:56,156
Could you do me a favor in return?

111
00:10:57,282 --> 00:10:59,909
Isn't it so tense
at the hospital these days?

112
00:11:00,743 --> 00:11:01,744
Is it?

113
00:11:02,370 --> 00:11:06,165
Well, nobody talks about it,
but everyone thinks it's weird.

114
00:11:06,166 --> 00:11:09,585
They're only keeping it quiet
because it's about Ms. Ko and Dr. Kang--

115
00:11:14,174 --> 00:11:15,632
Hey, are you okay?

116
00:11:17,093 --> 00:11:18,386
That was Dr. Ha, wasn't it?

117
00:11:18,970 --> 00:11:20,388
What's wrong with him? Darn it.

118
00:11:21,055 --> 00:11:22,056
Beats me.

119
00:12:06,434 --> 00:12:07,560
Dr. Cha.

120
00:12:08,770 --> 00:12:10,479
Are you at the hospital?

121
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:13,065
Going up.
The doors are closing.

122
00:12:13,066 --> 00:12:15,235
-  Dr. Ha!
- The doors are opening.

123
00:12:15,735 --> 00:12:17,487
- Oh, hello.
- Going up.

124
00:12:18,821 --> 00:12:20,156
The doors are closing.

125
00:12:21,908 --> 00:12:23,534
Working late tonight, Dr. Ha?

126
00:12:25,620 --> 00:12:26,621
Yeah.

127
00:12:28,206 --> 00:12:29,207
Me too.

128
00:12:35,713 --> 00:12:36,756
So…

129
00:12:37,507 --> 00:12:40,385
Dr. Choi said
he wants to see you right now.

130
00:12:42,971 --> 00:12:45,056
- He did?
- Yeah.

131
00:12:46,683 --> 00:12:49,227
I don't know what it's about,
but he asked me to tell you.

132
00:12:50,186 --> 00:12:52,397
He said to meet him
where you talked before.

133
00:12:53,481 --> 00:12:56,441
But the thing is,
I'm on my way to meet Dr. Ko.

134
00:12:56,442 --> 00:12:58,695
Well, Dr. Choi said it's pretty urgent.

135
00:13:14,794 --> 00:13:16,045
Well done.

136
00:13:35,773 --> 00:13:36,774
WING B

137
00:14:01,174 --> 00:14:02,258
Dr. Choi?

138
00:14:16,230 --> 00:14:18,900
It'll be over soon.

139
00:15:18,167 --> 00:15:19,752
Dr. Ha is dead.

140
00:15:28,594 --> 00:15:29,971
Why did you kill him?

141
00:15:34,684 --> 00:15:36,602
I thought you were just talking.

142
00:15:41,482 --> 00:15:44,318
- I said why did you kill him?
- You knew what was going to happen!

143
00:15:45,987 --> 00:15:47,572
What, you didn't know I'd do it?

144
00:15:52,368 --> 00:15:53,953
The cops will want to talk to you.

145
00:15:54,912 --> 00:15:56,247
You know what to say.

146
00:16:11,012 --> 00:16:13,890
Nothing's working out as planned.
Not one thing.

147
00:16:14,515 --> 00:16:15,516
That's it?

148
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:20,187
That's why you were going to kill my wife?

149
00:16:20,188 --> 00:16:23,858
If only you had stuck to the plan,
I wouldn't have had to.

150
00:16:26,319 --> 00:16:28,613
Take care of it
before things get any worse.

151
00:16:30,448 --> 00:16:31,532
Kill Kang Taeju.

152
00:16:34,994 --> 00:16:36,370
You'd better hurry.

153
00:16:36,871 --> 00:16:38,289
Your wife's running out of time.

154
00:16:41,209 --> 00:16:42,543
Watch it, man.

155
00:16:44,295 --> 00:16:45,838
Shut your damn mouth.

156
00:16:47,006 --> 00:16:48,966
Before I kill you.

157
00:16:50,509 --> 00:16:51,510
All right?

158
00:17:21,123 --> 00:17:22,291
Was it Choi Chiung?

159
00:17:23,751 --> 00:17:25,544
How did you find out?

160
00:17:26,796 --> 00:17:30,591
Someone had ordered Dr. Ha
to kill Kim Gyeongae.

161
00:17:31,342 --> 00:17:32,343
At first,

162
00:17:33,553 --> 00:17:34,929
I thought it was you.

163
00:17:39,892 --> 00:17:41,936
But once I realized that it wasn't you,

164
00:17:42,728 --> 00:17:44,647
there was only one person left.

165
00:17:45,940 --> 00:17:48,276
Someone who knew about the project,

166
00:17:49,652 --> 00:17:51,946
had access to potassium chloride,

167
00:17:53,072 --> 00:17:55,323
and knew about Kim Gyeongae's record

168
00:17:55,324 --> 00:17:58,160
and could use that information
to manipulate her and her husband.

169
00:17:59,787 --> 00:18:00,913
Choi Chiung.

170
00:18:04,667 --> 00:18:08,337
He's still at the hospital.

171
00:18:09,255 --> 00:18:11,173
I doubt there's any evidence left.

172
00:18:11,799 --> 00:18:13,758
If there were,
he would've escaped already.

173
00:18:13,759 --> 00:18:15,428
So what do you plan to do?

174
00:18:16,470 --> 00:18:19,098
You just have to act
like you're completely oblivious.

175
00:18:19,849 --> 00:18:21,100
Even with Seyun.

176
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:37,283
THE HUSBAND

177
00:19:05,561 --> 00:19:06,854
There you are.

178
00:19:07,521 --> 00:19:08,522
Hey.

179
00:19:10,691 --> 00:19:11,734
How are you holding up?

180
00:19:12,568 --> 00:19:13,611
Yeah, I'm fine.

181
00:19:15,446 --> 00:19:17,280
Good to hear. What about Seyun?

182
00:19:17,281 --> 00:19:19,492
Well, she's still struggling.

183
00:19:20,242 --> 00:19:22,078
Makes sense. It can't be easy.

184
00:19:22,703 --> 00:19:25,873
So much happened in such a short time.
Dr. Ha, and then Dr. Cha.

185
00:19:35,883 --> 00:19:37,176
You know, speaking of Dr. Ha…

186
00:19:38,052 --> 00:19:41,514
Do you think he really took his own life?

187
00:19:43,516 --> 00:19:44,642
What do you mean by that?

188
00:19:47,395 --> 00:19:49,146
I mean, Myeonghui is on the run.

189
00:19:50,272 --> 00:19:53,526
Plus, she was the last person
Dr. Ha was with before he died.

190
00:19:55,736 --> 00:19:58,823
So you think Myeonghui is
behind his death?

191
00:20:00,241 --> 00:20:02,827
Not necessarily.
I just thought it might be a possibility.

192
00:20:05,413 --> 00:20:06,579
I guess.

193
00:20:06,580 --> 00:20:08,832
I assume she ran away for a reason.

194
00:20:08,833 --> 00:20:11,627
If she had nothing to hide,
why would she have run?

195
00:20:15,923 --> 00:20:18,175
It's almost time for my appointment.
I have to go.

196
00:20:19,176 --> 00:20:20,177
Okay.

197
00:20:21,595 --> 00:20:22,596
Chiung.

198
00:20:24,348 --> 00:20:25,349
Yeah?

199
00:20:27,017 --> 00:20:29,645
Could Myeonghui really pull this off
all on her own?

200
00:20:35,067 --> 00:20:36,944
Well, I'm sure the cops
will figure it out.

201
00:20:39,739 --> 00:20:41,073
Don't think about it too much.

202
00:20:57,506 --> 00:21:00,259
Could Myeonghui
really pull this off on her own?

203
00:21:03,137 --> 00:21:04,138
There you are.

204
00:21:05,473 --> 00:21:06,474
Hey.

205
00:21:44,845 --> 00:21:46,429
How's it going, officer?

206
00:21:46,430 --> 00:21:47,932
I'm here to check on her.

207
00:22:04,907 --> 00:22:06,116
Goodness.

208
00:22:07,368 --> 00:22:09,954
Dr. Choi, what are you doing here?

209
00:22:10,871 --> 00:22:12,498
I saw the police just dropped by.

210
00:22:13,332 --> 00:22:14,457
What'd you talk about?

211
00:22:16,710 --> 00:22:19,295
They were asking about Dr. Cha.

212
00:22:19,296 --> 00:22:21,381
They asked if I knew where she went.

213
00:22:21,382 --> 00:22:22,465
And?

214
00:22:22,466 --> 00:22:25,427
I said I don't know.
Because I really don't.

215
00:22:28,514 --> 00:22:31,891
Well, then,
what about when Kang Taeju came by?

216
00:22:31,892 --> 00:22:33,310
Did you tell him anything?

217
00:22:33,894 --> 00:22:34,978
Why?

218
00:22:34,979 --> 00:22:36,397
Did he mention something?

219
00:22:37,606 --> 00:22:39,149
I'm the one asking questions here.

220
00:22:40,693 --> 00:22:42,570
I'm not sure what you mean.

221
00:22:43,362 --> 00:22:47,533
Oh, about how you told us
to take out Kang Taeju?

222
00:22:49,034 --> 00:22:50,286
Or about our deal?

223
00:22:54,456 --> 00:22:57,209
I didn't tell him anything.

224
00:22:59,003 --> 00:23:01,213
I did exactly as you said.

225
00:23:01,714 --> 00:23:05,634
I said Ha Jeongsoo called all the shots.
That's all I told him.

226
00:23:08,429 --> 00:23:10,222
Make sure you stick to that story.

227
00:23:11,015 --> 00:23:12,099
Hey, Doctor.

228
00:23:13,267 --> 00:23:14,476
Guess what?

229
00:23:16,020 --> 00:23:17,897
The cops said they'll be back soon.

230
00:23:19,982 --> 00:23:23,861
What I'll say then is up to you, isn't it?

231
00:23:26,363 --> 00:23:29,783
I don't think you quite understand
your situation right now.

232
00:23:30,743 --> 00:23:32,494
Your husband's a wanted man, right?

233
00:23:33,495 --> 00:23:34,872
And you're an accomplice.

234
00:23:36,832 --> 00:23:40,836
The cops are only giving you a break
because you're a patient.

235
00:23:45,716 --> 00:23:47,635
So don't get any stupid ideas.

236
00:23:49,470 --> 00:23:50,638
Ha Jeongsoo.

237
00:23:51,305 --> 00:23:52,806
You killed him, didn't you?

238
00:23:54,224 --> 00:23:55,225
Take care of yourself.

239
00:24:16,705 --> 00:24:19,958
Yes, exactly.
But I'm sure there'll be cameras, so…

240
00:24:19,959 --> 00:24:23,461
Yeah, if you keep searching,
I'm sure you'll find them.

241
00:24:23,462 --> 00:24:24,963
I'd suggest you look into those.

242
00:24:24,964 --> 00:24:26,756
I'll get in touch if we find anything.

243
00:24:26,757 --> 00:24:27,758
- Okay.
- All right.

244
00:24:34,306 --> 00:24:35,349
Hey, Chiung.

245
00:24:36,266 --> 00:24:37,309
What is it again?

246
00:24:37,851 --> 00:24:38,852
Is something going on?

247
00:24:39,687 --> 00:24:41,230
Nothing. It's just…

248
00:24:42,314 --> 00:24:45,067
I remembered something
while I was talking to you earlier.

249
00:24:46,110 --> 00:24:47,193
What?

250
00:24:47,194 --> 00:24:49,863
The day Dr. Ha died…

251
00:24:50,531 --> 00:24:54,659
I thought someone might've snuck in
and out through the fire doors.

252
00:24:54,660 --> 00:24:56,954
I told them, and they said
they'd check the footage.

253
00:24:58,455 --> 00:25:01,124
Yeah, of course they should look into it.

254
00:25:01,125 --> 00:25:02,459
Yes.

255
00:25:03,002 --> 00:25:05,254
Yeah, maybe they'll find something.

256
00:25:25,733 --> 00:25:27,192
Did the cameras capture my car?

257
00:25:28,485 --> 00:25:29,652
No. It's fine.

258
00:25:29,653 --> 00:25:31,697
But why would he bring that up
out of nowhere?

259
00:25:36,493 --> 00:25:37,494
Kang Taeju.

260
00:25:39,329 --> 00:25:41,749
You've been the problem all along.

261
00:26:01,894 --> 00:26:02,895
Hi.

262
00:26:06,190 --> 00:26:07,232
Dr. Choi.

263
00:26:07,983 --> 00:26:09,109
Yeah?

264
00:26:11,779 --> 00:26:14,113
There's been a change of plans
for today's surgery.

265
00:26:14,114 --> 00:26:16,491
What change? What are you talking about?

266
00:26:16,492 --> 00:26:19,036
Dr. Kang will be leading the surgery.

267
00:26:20,871 --> 00:26:22,164
It's Dr. Ko's orders.

268
00:26:39,890 --> 00:26:43,101
The fetal stem cell cultures
are ready for the next procedure.

269
00:26:43,102 --> 00:26:44,103
Hmm.

270
00:26:48,857 --> 00:26:50,651
The results are looking great.

271
00:26:51,777 --> 00:26:53,820
Your suggestion proved to be quite useful.

272
00:26:57,658 --> 00:26:59,701
I'd like to participate in the procedure.

273
00:27:01,787 --> 00:27:03,789
I've been a part
of this project from day one.

274
00:27:04,414 --> 00:27:05,915
I sourced the materials,

275
00:27:05,916 --> 00:27:07,501
and I'm the one doing the culturing.

276
00:27:09,044 --> 00:27:11,004
I'd like to be given
the opportunity, Dr. Ko.

277
00:27:11,880 --> 00:27:14,550
I'm not downplaying
your contributions here.

278
00:27:15,509 --> 00:27:16,885
But operating

279
00:27:17,469 --> 00:27:18,804
is a whole different issue.

280
00:27:19,888 --> 00:27:23,517
We'll talk again
once this project finds its footing.

281
00:27:26,854 --> 00:27:27,855
By the way,

282
00:27:28,564 --> 00:27:32,776
I'll be taking care of the supply
of fetal stem cells from now on.

283
00:27:35,320 --> 00:27:36,613
Thank you for your hard work.

284
00:27:37,990 --> 00:27:38,991
But…

285
00:27:53,380 --> 00:27:54,631
Did you guys hear?

286
00:27:55,757 --> 00:27:58,385
Apparently, Dr. Kang
won't be a part of the project anymore.

287
00:27:59,136 --> 00:28:01,680
- Are you serious?
- He must still be in shock

288
00:28:02,222 --> 00:28:03,723
after what happened to Hayun.

289
00:28:03,724 --> 00:28:05,600
What's happening with the project then?

290
00:28:05,601 --> 00:28:09,521
Dr. Choi will probably end up
doing the surgeries again, right?

291
00:28:16,612 --> 00:28:19,113
We've decided
to put this project on hold.

292
00:28:19,114 --> 00:28:21,157
What? On hold?

293
00:28:21,158 --> 00:28:23,117
I'm not sure I understand.

294
00:28:23,118 --> 00:28:26,204
We'll resume when Taeju comes back.

295
00:28:26,872 --> 00:28:29,206
Dr. Ko, I can do the surgeries.
Please reconsider--

296
00:28:29,207 --> 00:28:30,792
It's been decided.

297
00:28:32,669 --> 00:28:35,255
We're done here. You're dismissed.

298
00:29:03,241 --> 00:29:06,912
Come on, pick up.

299
00:29:12,960 --> 00:29:15,128
Pick up your phone, Noh Manhui.

300
00:29:16,296 --> 00:29:17,756
Pick up your damn phone!

301
00:29:35,190 --> 00:29:36,191
Come in.

302
00:29:37,442 --> 00:29:39,611
Oh, Seyun.

303
00:29:43,657 --> 00:29:45,784
What brings you here?

304
00:29:55,002 --> 00:29:56,086
Hmm…

305
00:29:58,046 --> 00:29:59,672
FUND DONATION AGREEMENT

306
00:29:59,673 --> 00:30:01,008
CLINICAL TRIAL APPLICATION

307
00:30:03,885 --> 00:30:05,137
I know everything.

308
00:30:06,179 --> 00:30:07,723
Including the fetal stem cells.

309
00:30:09,016 --> 00:30:11,350
Have a seat. Let's have a chat.

310
00:30:11,351 --> 00:30:12,477
Just tell me.

311
00:30:17,774 --> 00:30:19,026
I know.

312
00:30:19,609 --> 00:30:21,278
I know it's not right.

313
00:30:21,862 --> 00:30:22,863
But…

314
00:30:23,613 --> 00:30:26,032
I only did it to save the patients.

315
00:30:26,033 --> 00:30:27,909
Saving patients?

316
00:30:28,994 --> 00:30:30,495
You're right, it's important.

317
00:30:31,329 --> 00:30:32,997
You always said,

318
00:30:32,998 --> 00:30:36,543
"It's for the family, for the hospital,
and for the patients."

319
00:30:37,419 --> 00:30:38,754
But let me ask you, Dad.

320
00:30:39,379 --> 00:30:41,715
Are you sure it wasn't all just for you?

321
00:30:48,138 --> 00:30:50,265
You did this when Hayun died too.

322
00:30:52,601 --> 00:30:56,855
I called for Taeju
when Hayun was taken into the ER.

323
00:31:00,984 --> 00:31:03,235
But you kept him from coming.

324
00:31:03,236 --> 00:31:06,489
I didn't give up on Hayun.

325
00:31:06,490 --> 00:31:09,658
It's just that he was
in the middle of a procedure--

326
00:31:09,659 --> 00:31:11,286
And whose procedure was it?

327
00:31:14,664 --> 00:31:16,583
It was one of these people, wasn't it?

328
00:31:17,167 --> 00:31:18,710
Who bought their place in line.

329
00:31:20,670 --> 00:31:21,838
To you,

330
00:31:22,672 --> 00:31:24,883
family was never a priority.

331
00:31:25,509 --> 00:31:26,802
That's not true.

332
00:31:27,636 --> 00:31:29,262
Why do you think I did all of this?

333
00:31:29,888 --> 00:31:31,430
It was all for you--

334
00:31:31,431 --> 00:31:33,308
I know what you said to Taeju.

335
00:31:34,017 --> 00:31:36,269
You told him
to keep his mouth shut for me.

336
00:31:38,146 --> 00:31:39,689
And you know what?

337
00:31:44,986 --> 00:31:47,989
He was shouldering all the burden

338
00:31:49,699 --> 00:31:52,035
that you and I should have been carrying.

339
00:31:54,371 --> 00:31:56,832
Was that all for family too?

340
00:31:58,834 --> 00:31:59,918
And now…

341
00:32:05,132 --> 00:32:07,551
there are too many things
that can't be undone.

342
00:32:08,969 --> 00:32:09,970
But still…

343
00:32:12,055 --> 00:32:14,432
we have to make right what we can.

344
00:32:15,016 --> 00:32:17,060
And you have to be the one to do it.

345
00:32:31,449 --> 00:32:34,327
FUND DONATION AGREEMENT
CLINICAL TRIAL APPLICATION

346
00:32:46,298 --> 00:32:47,424
You okay?

347
00:32:59,186 --> 00:33:03,690
I'm sorry for making you carry
this burden you never should have.

348
00:33:04,941 --> 00:33:06,776
Stop saying that you're sorry.

349
00:33:08,570 --> 00:33:10,488
You've had it much worse than I did.

350
00:33:15,410 --> 00:33:16,828
We'll be okay, right?

351
00:33:20,582 --> 00:33:22,292
Yeah. We'll be fine.

352
00:33:28,673 --> 00:33:30,258
I'm going to make sure

353
00:33:32,093 --> 00:33:33,136
that we'll be fine.

354
00:33:45,065 --> 00:33:48,485
DIRECTOR KANG TAEJU

355
00:34:01,289 --> 00:34:02,790
Yeah, it's me, Kang Taeju.

356
00:34:02,791 --> 00:34:05,084
Did you look into what I told you?

357
00:34:05,085 --> 00:34:06,794
Yeah, we checked them.

358
00:34:06,795 --> 00:34:11,507
But the parking lot connected through
the fire doors doesn't have any cameras,

359
00:34:11,508 --> 00:34:14,261
and there are plenty
of blind spots nearby.

360
00:34:16,346 --> 00:34:18,889
We ran the plates from every vehicle
caught on camera

361
00:34:18,890 --> 00:34:21,809
and cross-checked them against
the hospital staff's plates,

362
00:34:21,810 --> 00:34:23,560
but nothing matched.

363
00:34:23,561 --> 00:34:25,021
Okay, got it.

364
00:35:01,433 --> 00:35:02,892
Why won't you pick up your phone?

365
00:35:03,393 --> 00:35:05,061
What did you do with Cha Myeonghui?

366
00:35:06,688 --> 00:35:07,814
What about her?

367
00:35:08,440 --> 00:35:09,941
Answer the damn question.

368
00:35:10,525 --> 00:35:12,402
You took care of her, right?

369
00:35:13,612 --> 00:35:14,613
I let her go.

370
00:35:15,280 --> 00:35:16,573
You let her go?

371
00:35:17,449 --> 00:35:18,575
You just let her go?

372
00:35:19,367 --> 00:35:21,535
Yeah.

373
00:35:21,536 --> 00:35:25,373
Are you insane?
You can't just let her go like that!

374
00:35:28,668 --> 00:35:33,173
I mean, what if she goes to the police?
If she does, we'll both be screwed.

375
00:35:35,383 --> 00:35:38,511
Maybe you will, not me.

376
00:35:43,642 --> 00:35:46,811
That woman is not capable
of doing whatever you're worried about.

377
00:35:47,646 --> 00:35:48,647
Well,

378
00:35:49,564 --> 00:35:51,858
she told me something very interesting.

379
00:35:53,234 --> 00:35:55,987
What you told her is very different

380
00:35:57,072 --> 00:35:58,531
from what you told me.

381
00:36:16,716 --> 00:36:18,802
You believe what she told you?

382
00:36:20,428 --> 00:36:22,097
Just take care of Kang Taeju already.

383
00:36:22,847 --> 00:36:24,933
He's been digging everywhere.

384
00:36:27,435 --> 00:36:28,728
I'll take care of it myself.

385
00:36:29,813 --> 00:36:32,315
Are you not worried
about your wife at all?

386
00:36:51,000 --> 00:36:53,586
WOORI TOGETHER MEDICAL CENTER

387
00:37:18,403 --> 00:37:20,195
- I'll go check it out.
- Yes, sir.

388
00:37:20,196 --> 00:37:21,739
POLICE

389
00:37:21,740 --> 00:37:23,782
-  What's going on?
-  I'll go check it out.

390
00:37:23,783 --> 00:37:25,576
I'll see what's going on over there.

391
00:37:25,577 --> 00:37:26,786
I'll try to call them.

392
00:37:27,996 --> 00:37:29,122
Hello?

393
00:37:31,541 --> 00:37:34,502
Hello? Anyone there?

394
00:37:35,879 --> 00:37:38,756
- What's the matter?
- What's going on outside?

395
00:37:38,757 --> 00:37:40,215
Is there a fire?

396
00:37:40,216 --> 00:37:41,884
We're looking into it. Just wait.

397
00:37:41,885 --> 00:37:43,844
Wait, officer!

398
00:37:43,845 --> 00:37:48,766
Don't leave me all alone here.
I'm handcuffed to the bed right now.

399
00:37:48,767 --> 00:37:49,768
It'll just be a moment.

400
00:37:50,351 --> 00:37:51,810
Hey!

401
00:37:51,811 --> 00:37:53,896
What if I burn to death in this room?

402
00:37:53,897 --> 00:37:56,482
What will you do then?

403
00:38:20,089 --> 00:38:22,300
There were no signs of a fire
within the hospital.

404
00:38:22,801 --> 00:38:26,888
We checked the control room logs,
and the fire alarm was set off manually.

405
00:38:27,472 --> 00:38:28,598
Where's the control room?

406
00:38:29,182 --> 00:38:30,599
It's located in B1.

407
00:38:30,600 --> 00:38:31,976
What about cameras?

408
00:38:32,685 --> 00:38:34,729
We don't have any cameras in that sector.

409
00:38:37,607 --> 00:38:38,690
-  Captain.
-  Yeah.

410
00:38:38,691 --> 00:38:42,402
We did a full sweep of the hospital,
but we didn't find anything suspicious.

411
00:38:42,403 --> 00:38:45,113
We're searching the area too,
but we haven't found anything.

412
00:38:45,114 --> 00:38:47,574
And the officer
who was guarding Kim Gyeongae's room

413
00:38:47,575 --> 00:38:49,368
said he was ambushed from behind.

414
00:38:49,369 --> 00:38:51,995
He's regained consciousness,
but he didn't see who it was.

415
00:38:51,996 --> 00:38:55,457
We checked the surveillance footage too,
but the alarm caused crowding,

416
00:38:55,458 --> 00:38:57,502
so we haven't been able
to identify anyone yet.

417
00:38:58,002 --> 00:39:01,172
A fire alarm
and an officer getting ambushed?

418
00:39:02,048 --> 00:39:03,299
This was orchestrated.

419
00:39:04,092 --> 00:39:06,802
Pull every visitor log for the hospital
and call for backup.

420
00:39:06,803 --> 00:39:08,221
- Yes, sir.
- On it.

421
00:39:09,138 --> 00:39:11,265
We can get you the entry logs.

422
00:39:11,266 --> 00:39:12,433
Great, thank you.

423
00:39:25,321 --> 00:39:26,698
The doors are opening.

424
00:39:28,575 --> 00:39:30,325
Going up.

425
00:39:30,326 --> 00:39:33,829
WING B

426
00:39:48,136 --> 00:39:49,429
Where's my wife?

427
00:39:50,179 --> 00:39:51,180
It wasn't me.

428
00:39:56,811 --> 00:39:58,478
Where's my wife?

429
00:39:58,479 --> 00:39:59,814
It wasn't me.

430
00:40:00,648 --> 00:40:01,816
It wasn't you?

431
00:40:02,525 --> 00:40:04,027
I know you took her.

432
00:40:06,237 --> 00:40:07,864
I thought it was you.

433
00:40:12,827 --> 00:40:16,330
Hey, look at me.

434
00:40:16,331 --> 00:40:17,498
Look at me!

435
00:40:20,585 --> 00:40:21,960
Look at me.

436
00:41:15,515 --> 00:41:18,809
PYEONGWON FUNERAL HOME
PYEONGWON NURSING HOME

437
00:41:18,810 --> 00:41:20,395
BUSINESS CLOSED
UNDER 24 HOUR PATROL

438
00:41:57,432 --> 00:42:00,018
You…

439
00:42:02,061 --> 00:42:03,730
Why are you doing this?

440
00:42:31,924 --> 00:42:35,219
Why the hell are you doing this?

441
00:42:37,847 --> 00:42:40,767
What, you want revenge
or something, Doctor?

442
00:42:42,643 --> 00:42:43,644
Huh?

443
00:42:45,104 --> 00:42:48,066
Say something. Why won't you answer me?

444
00:42:50,818 --> 00:42:54,155
Say something, will you?

445
00:43:00,578 --> 00:43:01,704
Why?

446
00:43:04,082 --> 00:43:05,165
Are you scared?

447
00:43:12,715 --> 00:43:14,175
Do you get it now?

448
00:43:15,259 --> 00:43:18,346
How my wife must have felt in that room?

449
00:43:35,446 --> 00:43:36,656
What the hell is that?

450
00:43:41,744 --> 00:43:42,911
What are you doing?

451
00:43:42,912 --> 00:43:43,913
Just an IV drip.

452
00:43:45,206 --> 00:43:47,250
With a little bit of painkillers.

453
00:43:48,793 --> 00:43:50,795
It hasn't been long since you had surgery.

454
00:43:52,296 --> 00:43:53,923
You shouldn't move around too much.

455
00:43:55,842 --> 00:43:57,593
You'll be here for a while.

456
00:44:01,264 --> 00:44:05,600
Why did you put me in this place?
What the hell are you trying to do?

457
00:44:09,772 --> 00:44:14,485
My husband will not let you
get away with this.

458
00:44:15,027 --> 00:44:16,070
Got that?

459
00:44:17,822 --> 00:44:19,115
Yeah, I know.

460
00:44:20,408 --> 00:44:21,492
Look here.

461
00:44:21,993 --> 00:44:23,369
Doctor!

462
00:44:30,042 --> 00:44:32,670
WOORI TOGETHER MEDICAL CENTER

463
00:44:49,061 --> 00:44:50,396
- Hey.
- Hey.

464
00:44:52,273 --> 00:44:53,899
Do you think the hospital's cursed?

465
00:44:53,900 --> 00:44:56,068
It's just one thing after another.

466
00:44:56,861 --> 00:44:57,987
Tell me about it.

467
00:44:59,405 --> 00:45:01,406
Have the cops not found Kim Gyeongae yet?

468
00:45:01,407 --> 00:45:03,034
Yeah, it seems that way.

469
00:45:03,826 --> 00:45:05,161
Where on earth did she go?

470
00:45:06,412 --> 00:45:08,122
She probably can't even walk yet.

471
00:45:09,707 --> 00:45:11,792
It has to be her husband, right?

472
00:45:12,460 --> 00:45:13,668
Her husband?

473
00:45:13,669 --> 00:45:15,754
You think he came in here,
set off the alarm,

474
00:45:15,755 --> 00:45:17,589
and took her under the cops' noses?

475
00:45:17,590 --> 00:45:18,591
Why?

476
00:45:19,217 --> 00:45:20,635
You think it's someone else?

477
00:45:21,260 --> 00:45:22,261
Uh…

478
00:45:23,095 --> 00:45:27,015
They set off the fire alarm on purpose,
so it had to be planned.

479
00:45:27,016 --> 00:45:28,935
And they knew the blind spots.

480
00:45:30,353 --> 00:45:34,065
It sounds like someone who knows
the hospital inside and out, like us.

481
00:45:36,317 --> 00:45:37,318
Hmm…

482
00:45:41,697 --> 00:45:43,282
If it's not her husband,

483
00:45:44,909 --> 00:45:48,454
why would anyone take her away?

484
00:45:52,458 --> 00:45:53,626
Maybe they need her.

485
00:45:56,087 --> 00:45:57,171
Why would they need her?

486
00:46:02,551 --> 00:46:04,178
Maybe there was something

487
00:46:05,721 --> 00:46:07,890
to be gained by taking her away from here.

488
00:46:58,024 --> 00:46:59,191
Kang Taeju.

489
00:47:01,319 --> 00:47:02,986
So it was you.

490
00:47:02,987 --> 00:47:04,697
POTASSIUM CHLORIDE

491
00:47:07,158 --> 00:47:08,993
I'll do it myself, then.

492
00:47:12,747 --> 00:47:14,748
WING B

493
00:47:14,749 --> 00:47:16,334
The doors are closing.

494
00:49:26,130 --> 00:49:27,256
You took her, didn't you?

495
00:49:28,174 --> 00:49:29,175
Where is my wife?

496
00:49:29,925 --> 00:49:31,718
Don't worry, your wife's fine.

497
00:49:31,719 --> 00:49:32,887
She's in a safe place.

498
00:49:33,679 --> 00:49:35,096
A safe place?

499
00:49:35,097 --> 00:49:36,682
Where's that? Huh?

500
00:49:37,308 --> 00:49:41,312
Wherever she is, she's safer
away from Choi Chiung, don't you think?

501
00:49:45,399 --> 00:49:48,985
When you said I was the target,
things started to click one by one.

502
00:49:48,986 --> 00:49:49,987
As to why…

503
00:49:55,034 --> 00:49:56,868
Why you tried to kill me,

504
00:49:56,869 --> 00:49:57,912
and why…

505
00:49:58,496 --> 00:50:01,373
he lied that your wife didn't make the cut
because of her prior…

506
00:50:03,083 --> 00:50:05,920
And why she couldn't rat out Choi Chiung…

507
00:50:07,922 --> 00:50:10,257
even though she knew he tried to kill her.

508
00:50:12,051 --> 00:50:14,136
She didn't want to break off the deal.

509
00:50:16,472 --> 00:50:20,267
He promised to get your wife that surgery
in return for killing me.

510
00:50:26,357 --> 00:50:27,983
I'll do that surgery.

511
00:50:29,944 --> 00:50:32,071
The surgery Chiung promised you.

512
00:50:34,156 --> 00:50:35,324
I'll do it.

513
00:50:36,450 --> 00:50:37,451
What?

514
00:50:39,995 --> 00:50:41,330
But I have a condition.

515
00:50:45,209 --> 00:50:46,502
Turn yourself in.

516
00:50:47,211 --> 00:50:49,922
Tell the cops
everything Chiung told you to do.

517
00:50:50,714 --> 00:50:53,092
And what makes you think I'd trust you?

518
00:50:56,720 --> 00:50:58,889
You think you can trust Choi Chiung?

519
00:51:02,935 --> 00:51:06,063
He will never hold up
his end of the bargain.

520
00:51:10,192 --> 00:51:14,487
It's your fault my wife
didn't get her surgery, all right?

521
00:51:14,488 --> 00:51:17,198
And now you want to do that surgery?

522
00:51:17,199 --> 00:51:18,200
Says who?

523
00:51:19,577 --> 00:51:21,287
Did Choi Chiung tell you that?

524
00:51:22,913 --> 00:51:24,373
The choice is yours.

525
00:51:25,499 --> 00:51:27,585
Turn yourself in, and your wife lives.

526
00:51:28,252 --> 00:51:29,878
Let me know. I'll be waiting.

527
00:51:50,858 --> 00:51:53,610
Says who?

528
00:51:53,611 --> 00:51:55,321
Did Choi Chiung tell you that?

529
00:51:57,948 --> 00:51:59,658
Yes, come in.

530
00:52:06,707 --> 00:52:09,042
Dr. Choi, this is the couple
I talked to you about.

531
00:52:09,043 --> 00:52:11,086
Come on in. Have a seat.

532
00:52:12,129 --> 00:52:13,421
Have a seat, honey.

533
00:52:13,422 --> 00:52:16,091
Why don't we catch up afterward, Dr. Cha?

534
00:52:16,759 --> 00:52:17,760
Uh…

535
00:52:19,386 --> 00:52:20,387
Okay.

536
00:52:36,320 --> 00:52:38,988
I bet you were crushed
when you heard you didn't make it.

537
00:52:38,989 --> 00:52:42,826
Well, it is what it is, I guess.

538
00:52:46,205 --> 00:52:49,124
I thought it'd be best
to be candid about this

539
00:52:49,750 --> 00:52:52,086
and tell you the real reason
you didn't get selected.

540
00:52:57,383 --> 00:52:59,843
It's because
of your criminal record, Ms. Kim.

541
00:53:00,719 --> 00:53:02,512
But how would you know about that?

542
00:53:02,513 --> 00:53:05,599
We run background checks
on all applicants.

543
00:53:06,308 --> 00:53:09,895
So, is there no way
that my wife can get her surgery at all?

544
00:53:10,688 --> 00:53:15,108
Uh…
Unless you have massive sums of money.

545
00:53:15,109 --> 00:53:17,318
That tends to open up some doors.

546
00:53:17,319 --> 00:53:22,408
So you're saying ex-cons with no money
like me can just kick the bucket?

547
00:53:23,826 --> 00:53:26,495
This is why I told you I wouldn't sign up.

548
00:53:28,580 --> 00:53:31,250
But even if you had the money,
it wouldn't work.

549
00:53:34,586 --> 00:53:37,588
We're actually about
to shut down this project.

550
00:53:37,589 --> 00:53:40,299
What are you talking about?

551
00:53:40,300 --> 00:53:43,387
The hospital director says
he won't continue without his son-in-law.

552
00:53:44,388 --> 00:53:45,555
His son-in-law?

553
00:53:45,556 --> 00:53:48,182
A doctor named Kang Taeju
is married to his daughter,

554
00:53:48,183 --> 00:53:50,561
and he wanted out of the project.

555
00:53:51,729 --> 00:53:55,064
He had no problem
operating with illegal material

556
00:53:55,065 --> 00:53:57,942
until he realized he might take the heat.

557
00:53:57,943 --> 00:54:01,280
So then the director decided
that he'd call it quits after this round.

558
00:54:03,115 --> 00:54:07,578
So this Kang Taeju is the reason
my wife can't get her procedure?

559
00:54:08,912 --> 00:54:11,123
And what's this illegal material anyway?

560
00:54:11,790 --> 00:54:16,128
Well, this is sort of confidential,

561
00:54:18,088 --> 00:54:19,714
but procedures like this

562
00:54:19,715 --> 00:54:23,343
usually require stem cells
harvested from the patient's own body.

563
00:54:24,011 --> 00:54:25,345
But the hospital director here

564
00:54:26,680 --> 00:54:29,223
decided it'd be better
to get them from aborted fetuses.

565
00:54:29,224 --> 00:54:31,727
What? Aborted fetuses?

566
00:54:32,770 --> 00:54:33,937
It's despicable.

567
00:54:35,230 --> 00:54:37,190
But it yields better results,

568
00:54:37,191 --> 00:54:38,734
so they use it on the sly.

569
00:54:40,152 --> 00:54:42,153
They do all this shady stuff,

570
00:54:42,154 --> 00:54:45,532
but they deny your treatment
just because you're an ex-convict.

571
00:54:46,700 --> 00:54:50,329
You see, I've been a part
of this project since day one.

572
00:54:50,829 --> 00:54:54,415
I started before Kang, I've done more
research and surgeries than he ever did.

573
00:54:54,416 --> 00:54:55,918
But just because he's out…

574
00:55:06,136 --> 00:55:07,763
With Kang Taeju out of the picture…

575
00:55:09,848 --> 00:55:11,891
the director will
eventually stop holding out

576
00:55:11,892 --> 00:55:13,435
and resume the project.

577
00:55:15,938 --> 00:55:20,484
And then I might be able to
operate on Ms. Kim here as well.

578
00:55:22,486 --> 00:55:24,695
You're saying if we got rid of him--

579
00:55:24,696 --> 00:55:25,697
Hey.

580
00:55:27,115 --> 00:55:28,742
You could save my wife, right?

581
00:55:29,701 --> 00:55:30,702
Yes.

582
00:55:31,453 --> 00:55:32,955
Get Kang Taeju out of the picture,

583
00:55:33,664 --> 00:55:34,915
and I promise

584
00:55:35,791 --> 00:55:37,584
I'll save your wife's life at all costs.

585
00:55:40,796 --> 00:55:43,549
I hope you keep your word, Doctor.

586
00:55:44,883 --> 00:55:48,512
Because if you don't,
the rest of your life will be

587
00:55:49,888 --> 00:55:51,014
a living hell.

588
00:55:52,057 --> 00:55:53,350
I'll keep my word.

589
00:55:54,685 --> 00:55:56,103
So will I.

590
00:56:37,936 --> 00:56:39,021
Yeah.

591
00:57:23,649 --> 00:57:25,108
If I do as you tell me,

592
00:57:26,735 --> 00:57:28,528
you'll operate on my wife, right?

593
00:57:31,615 --> 00:57:32,699
And she'll…

594
00:57:34,785 --> 00:57:36,578
She'll get to live, right?

595
00:57:42,376 --> 00:57:44,169
Don't worry. I'll do my best.

596
00:57:47,464 --> 00:57:48,757
Keep your word.

597
00:57:50,133 --> 00:57:51,885
I'll do as you say.

598
00:57:55,347 --> 00:57:56,640
You better keep your word.

599
00:58:13,949 --> 00:58:15,367
Don't you worry.

600
00:58:43,687 --> 00:58:48,607
THE HUSBAND

601
00:59:28,940 --> 00:59:31,108
Where is Ms. Kim Gyeongae?

602
00:59:31,109 --> 00:59:34,361
If we leave her like this,
she'll be paralyzed from the waist down.

603
00:59:34,362 --> 00:59:36,947
The procedure that you wanted.
It needs to be done now.

604
00:59:36,948 --> 00:59:39,700
Everything Choi Chiung put me up to…
I have all the evidence.

605
00:59:41,286 --> 00:59:42,578
Just do the surgery,

606
00:59:42,579 --> 00:59:44,413
I'll hand it over and turn myself in.

607
00:59:44,414 --> 00:59:47,416
I think you're forgetting
that your wife's life is in my hands.

608
00:59:47,417 --> 00:59:49,293
You know whose fault that is?

609
00:59:49,294 --> 00:59:51,922
Today, you and your husband…
You're both dead.

610
00:59:52,464 --> 00:59:53,798
I said let go!

611
00:59:53,799 --> 00:59:57,135
I can't let you and your wife
get off that easy.

612
01:00:00,639 --> 01:00:02,641
Translated by Hyun Sik Yoon
